  "notes": [
    "**Elegir** is a stem-changing verb: e→i, with spelling changes",
    "Present: stem change e→i (except nosotros) plus spelling change g→j before o (elijo)",
    "Preterite: stem change e→i in 3rd person forms (eligió, eligieron)",
    "Imperfect: regular -IR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **elegido**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Same pattern as **corregir** (to correct)",
    "Common usage: *elegir una opción* (to choose an option), *elegir presidente* (to elect president)",
    "Related noun: **la elección** (choice, election)",
    "Related adjective: **elegido/a** (chosen, elected)"
  ],
